ok 1 - Zero is an Armstrong number
ok 2 - Single-digit numbers are Armstrong numbers
ok 3 - There are no two-digit Armstrong numbers
ok 4 - Three-digit number that is an Armstrong number
ok 5 - Three-digit number that is not an Armstrong number
ok 6 - Four-digit number that is an Armstrong number
ok 7 - Four-digit number that is not an Armstrong number
ok 8 - Seven-digit number that is an Armstrong number
ok 9 - Seven-digit number that is not an Armstrong number
ok 10 - Armstrong number containing seven zeroes
ok 11 - The largest and last Armstrong number
1..11
